{
  "episode_id": 1110110,
  "chapter_id": 11101,
  "chapter_title": "The Theft of the Rimet Cup",
  "display_label": "",
  "title": "A Small Gift",
  "subtitle": "Don't mention it. It's the least he can do.",
  "trails": [],
  "segments": [
    {
      "script_id": "200116",
      "internal_title": "【1.1】雷米特杯-10",
      "items": [
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "Charlton and the puppies arrive at the Rimet Cup Exhibition."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "It's supposed to be a happy family gathering. Everyone thinks so."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "Except Pickles."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Wendy",
          "text": "Woof woof!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof, woof woof."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Wendy",
          "text": "Woof woof!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof woof."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "Pickles glances at Charlton, who is busy at the ticket office."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof woof, woof."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof ... woof woof."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Wendy",
          "text": "Woof! Woof!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "The little bulldog keeps pushing Pickles, hinting that he should move forward."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof ... woof!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Wendy",
          "text": "Woof! Woof!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "More puppies come from around Charlton and surround Pickles. He is always the most popular pup."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Alice",
          "text": "Woof!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Nelson",
          "text": "Woof woof woof!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof, woof woof."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "The puppies nod together."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof …"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "Pickles is about to say something more, while Charlton's indignant grumbling interrupts it."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Charlton",
          "text": "It says clearly on the leaflet, \"We welcome everyone who loves football\"!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Security Guard",
          "text": "Yes, mister."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Charlton",
          "text": "Then you should let us in!!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Charlton",
          "text": "Me, Wendy, Alice, Nelson, and little Pickles. We all love football!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Security Guard",
          "text": "I'm sorry, but no pets are allowed in here."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Security Guard",
          "text": "We provide \"pet-keeping services\" with professional police dog guarding."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "The security guard points to the huge cage next to him. There are various mini-footballs and puppy toys."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "A dark police dog slouches in the doorway."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Charlton",
          "text": "Ugh ..."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "Charlton hesitantly picks up one of the lemon-yellow balls and squeezes it hard."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Wendy",
          "text": "Woof woof!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Nelson",
          "text": "Woof woof!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "The little bulldog jumps up and takes the ball out of Charlton's hand, rushing to its new playground. Other puppies follow closely behind."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "Toys are toys, delightful toys. Obviously, no one really cares as much about the size and colour of the football as humans do."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Charlton",
          "text": "Oh! Don't bump your head, Wendy!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Charlton",
          "text": "Looks like we'll all have a good place to go."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Charlton",
          "text": "Have a great time in the puppy land!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "Charlton waves his hands firmly, then turns and disappears into the visitors."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Wendy",
          "text": "Wooooof! Woof!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Alice",
          "text": "Woof!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof woof, woof woof."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Alice",
          "text": "Woooof?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Nelson",
          "text": "Woof woof!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof woof."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "The security dog lying in the doorway pats Pickles on the shoulder."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Police Dog",
          "text": "Woof!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof, woof woof."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Police Dog",
          "text": "Woof woof ..."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof woof woof, woof?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Police Dog",
          "text": "Woof woof!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "The security dog nods its head seriously."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Wendy",
          "text": "Woof woof!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Alice",
          "text": "Woof."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof, woof woof."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Police Dog",
          "text": "Woof woof woof, woof ..."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof, woof woof …"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Police Dog",
          "text": "Woof woof woof, woof!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof, woof woof …"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Alice",
          "text": "Woof?!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Nelson",
          "text": "Woof woof!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "The puppies listen carefully and discuss with each other."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof ... Woof …"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Police Dog",
          "text": "Woof!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "Something suddenly pops into Pickles's mind. He turns around to look at the line at the door slowly pushing its way into the exhibition hall."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "Charlton is no longer among them."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Police Dog",
          "text": "Woof woof!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof woof ... woof."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "Pickles shows his excellence as a border collie."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "He dodges all the thorns and fences with aplomb, just like a real hero."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof ... woof woof."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof woof, woof …"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "Pickles's eyes fall on a small hole in the fence."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "It's common knowledge that apples fall from trees occasionally."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "Lovely to see you again, puppy with blue eyes."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "This APPLe has accepted a commission from Captain to investigate the venue."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof ... woof woof!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "Oh, right ..."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "Since last time we met, this APPLe has been contemplating how to communicate with you."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "So, here it is."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "A simple translator—“Doggie.”"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "It's still under testing, so the functions are not complete. Sometimes it just stops working."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "Also, it might somehow misunderstand dog language."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "APPLe hands the translator to Pickles. After a brief hesitation, Pickles takes it."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof woof ... woof."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "\"Doggie\"",
          "text": "The puppy expresses his gratitude."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "It's my pleasure."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "It's a pity that this APPLe doesn't have adequate time to test it."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "You'd better leave as soon as possible. Those violent security robots may show up at any time."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "\"Doggie\"",
          "text": "The puppy expresses his denial."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "Hmm?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof woof woof woof …"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "\"Doggie\"",
          "text": "There is something very important for the puppy inside."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "The puppy falls silent."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "Oh, I see. Fair enough."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "Let's head forward. In the face of danger, this APPLe will do his utmost to assist."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "APPLe lands on Pickles's back. They are both ready to go."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "",
          "text": "After a short assist, Pickles makes a perfect arc through the air and easily goes through the broken security fence."
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "APPLe",
          "text": "Whoaa!"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Pickles",
          "text": "Woof woof …"
        },
        {
          "kind": "title_card",
          "text": "TO BE CONTINUED ..."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "fallback_fields": []
}